  "collectionNotes": [
    "精确SKU的官方产品、资源及开发资料、原始程序ZIP、固定M5Burner公开分类与UIFlow/小智发布记录中，未确认独立出厂恢复镜像。官方示例和MicroPython维持example/development身份。",
    "适配范围为精确SKU容量、GPIO/LEDC/RMT数字输出及已声明的BOOT输入；不据此宣称完整原厂应用通过。",
    "USB桥接/集线器、射频、模拟电压、电流、热特性与实机刷写未验收。RESET使用平台重启操作，不伪装成普通GPIO按键。",
    "排针、内存与天线选项分别建档；原四基础款的原BIN执行证据只属于原型号和原镜像，不向新增SKU继承。",
    "Newly generated model with new hashes and new validation. Historical batch-04 reviews are not acceptance of these artifacts.",
    "No physical fit, material calibration, complete hidden layout, original application compatibility or hardware acceptance is implied.",
    "Exact manufacturer nativeN8R8 assembly; board trace/stackup editing and physical fit remain unverified.",
    "Published25.4×63.3mm and native25.42068576×63.31069634mm PCB extents differ slightly. Native source is not scaled to erase the discrepancy.",
    "The bare variant omits only the two native pre-soldered headers. The-M variant retains all420 source components, including the complete sourceUSB topology."
  ]
